 together. You are two players fighting over one body. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>GET RID OF EVERYTHING THAT BOTHERS YOU</strong></i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974210/extras/192a1be39695e36ae3ae01695690a530.poster.avif?t=1771595961\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974210/extras/192a1be39695e36ae3ae01695690a530.webm?t=1771595961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974210/extras/192a1be39695e36ae3ae01695690a530.mp4?t=1771595961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Kick obstacles to break paths or unleash unexpected chaos. But think twice before kicking innocent things, they might be your nightmare. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>PHYSICS-DRIVEN MAYHEM</strong></i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974210/extras/6d2ab948faa88bf310a0734eb30fac2a.poster.avif?t=1771595961\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974210/extras/6d2ab948faa88bf310a0734eb30fac2a.webm?t=1771595961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974210/extras/6d2ab948faa88bf310a0734eb30fac2a.mp4?t=1771595961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The zombie king is far from graceful \u2014 every step wobbles, arms swing uncontrollably, and one wrong move can turn into a full ragdoll disaster. Physics transforms simple actions into chaotic fun as you kick objects, shake trees for falling apples, and throw anything you can get your hands on. SURVIVE THE JOURNEY Reach the throne by surviving deadly challenges. Fall into water or plunge from great heights? The witch\u2019s magic returns you to checkpoints so you can fail forward together. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>ONLINE OR LOCAL CO-OP</strong></i>\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974210/extras/27bdd5f8836c91bdfdf82804e7b7ab44.avif?t=1771595961\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974210/extras_big/27bdd5f8836c91bdfdf82804e7b7ab44.webp?t=1771595961 width=1560 height=504 /></span>Play solo in local co-op or team up online \u2014 coordination is key whether you\u2019re side by side or miles apart. </p>","developers":["Psps Game Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974210/c26d47de5a92c30dfeec53068cecf6cc255f2042/header.jpg?t=1771595961","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3974210/1453289873/717c5d87310b89b83217c02be687b61e7c7ae0e0/1755727850/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757273374","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3974210/1453289873/717c5d87310b89b83217c02be687b61e7c7ae0e0/1755727850/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757273374","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3974210/1453289873/717c5d87310b89b83217c02be687b61e7c7ae0e0/1755727850/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1757273374","id":257186322,"name":"ZomBFFs_GameplayTrailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257186322/2dbb067231a381387248d354f3bd39914531da25/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757273